# Next.js build artifacts — Vercel rebuilds every satellite from source, so
# committing these adds ~570 files per site and, worse, makes EVERY satellite's
# folder look changed on any commit that touches them. Each satellite's
# ignore-build command is `git diff --quiet HEAD^ HEAD -- backlink-sites/<name>`
# (CLAUDE.md §17.1), so committed artifacts trigger all 35 satellites to rebuild
# against the Hobby deploy quota for no reason. Flagged in §13 as cleanup;
# actioned 2026-08-16 after it cost a full rebuild round.
**/.next/
**/node_modules/
